00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.620
The way I used to be around drugs,

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.090
how I got introduced to you them.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.316
What I started with.

00:00:10.316 --> 00:00:11.990
I always hear a lot of people say,

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.810
they started with marijuana.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.983
Me, myself, I didn't have that luxury.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.510
Me and my little brother one time

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.660
we were getting out of school,

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.760
we we're real young,

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.800
