00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.070
So, I wanted to be curious
to see what it did to you,

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.900
so, we end up smoking it.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.480
Now, we were 12 and 11 years old.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.667
I remember me and my
little brother smoked it

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:02.170
and I remember the feeling
of being like strong

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.080
as like, strong, like 10 guys.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.480
It made me feel like a
strong, like for 10 guys.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.060
So we smoked it.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.870
The next day I went back
with my little brother

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.430
