00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.900
We used to see my father
deal with his drugs

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.180
but he was dealing with heroin.

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:32.460
And I remember, I used to
hear them talk about it.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.090
Back then it was a quarter spoon, $25,

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.430
and you would get high one time,

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.660
