00:01:45.808 --> 00:01:47.640
So, I used to watch my father,

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.650
deal his little heroin,

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.630
but he also sell weed on the side.

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.620
And we're interested in the weed.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.700
Well, I had a friend down the street

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:56.800
