00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.840
So, we had school the
next day and I was like,

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.520
you know what, I'm going
to take it to school,

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.620
I'm going to be cool himself,

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.453
a few dimes,

00:02:25.453 --> 00:02:26.286
