00:02:33.014 --> 00:02:34.550
It was like the third
time I had smoked weed.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:35.530
So, we smoked the joint.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:39.070
I was already nervous going
to school but I went anyways.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:40.040
When I got there,

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.240
I kept smelling the fragrance of weed.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.073
While I was young,

00:02:43.073 --> 00:02:45.290
I didn't realize that
the weed was coming out

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.420
