00:02:57.307 --> 00:03:01.100
And they decided they
wanted to go to the field.

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.390
So, I was like, 'Okay, let's go.'.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:04.250
So, we went up to the
field and we're up there,

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.030
