00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.240
I put it on my lap,

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.950
I put some rolling papers out and...

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.420
Mind you, I'm barely learning how to roll

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.310
